{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53060","headline":"五言南岳寺普上人院一首 · 郎士元","name":"五言南岳寺普上人院一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云深石涧寺，树老远公房。\n终日风□□，□秋景气凉。\n醍醐蒙□味，□□□□□。\n□见无生理，空山坐道场。\n（以上二首均见日本藏唐抄本《唐诗卷》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}